  "target": "studyflow_android",
  "description": "OV17 closes Android attention delivery, widget resilience and remote ATT10 recipient policy findings with per-widget isolation, self-healing observers, timezone refresh, expired snooze purge, stable notification IDs and canonical remote taps.",
